          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation and photography from a cruise ship of an extremely bright white phenomenon in the night sky: observation of Jupiter.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "8fa732e132b44419005b6f5d0c7b66fb3a14fc92c781f113cf780f9efcedb92a"
